  "title": "UIBackgroundNode",
  "description": "The node a widget's painted surface currently uses: a Graphics for a vector fill, a NineSliceSprite or RepeatingSprite for a texture, an AnimatedSprite for a clip. Widgets expose theirs so a caller can reach the live node for effects or measurements; the widget owns it and swaps it whenever the skin's background kind changes.",
